                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is so underappreciated as the only Officer Play Nobunaga's Ambition game. While SOI  PUK is mostly ruler with a better balanced micromanaging system, Ascension gives you the option to play in the Sengoku era your way with the Create Historical Events feature. Happy 10th Annivesary Ascension! There's no Sengoku game like this(I'm looking at you Sengoku Dynasty....) playing as a cheap spear/sword officer climbing your way up into the Shogun. Taiko Rissiden V DX comes abit close.....",
